        "notes": "# .\u00b7:*\u00a8\u00a8* \u2248\u2606Round 7\u2606\u2248 *\u00a8\u00a8*:\u00b7.\n\nRound 7 \u2014 the final round. This is where we need to heavily support our team with both healing and damage.\n\nWe start with  [Battle Medic](item_ccd0edff-4d57-4ac2-83a7-bab6ff0ffb2f) , every Mercy main\u2019s other best friend.\n\nI usually sell [Icy] and pick up  [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48)  to increase our movement and healing speeds.\n\nOptional items at this stage depend on the enemy team and their builds. If their tank is  [Reinhardt](hero_a3b6ca2c-6cbd-43dc-bb78-a728e42fba49) ,  [Orisa](hero_91644d44-1093-4f62-ac51-020975465e85) , or  [D.Va](hero_e8e1dc68-45c4-47c2-b421-95e33594e6b6) , I like to grab  [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27)  to help shred their armor.\nBut ideally, you\u2019ve already secured the win before Round 7!",
